<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Bentley, Gerhardt & Bates (2008) PLoS Comput. Biol., Hellström et al. (2007) Nature & Jakobsson et al. (2010) Nat. Cell Biol. VEGF-VEGFR2-Dll4-Notch1 tip/stalk salt-and-pepper lateral inhibition and angiogenic sprouting (Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (Retinal & embryonic sprouting vascular endothelium))",
        "Bentley, Gerhardt & Bates (2008) PLoS Comput. Biol., Hellström et al. (2007) Nature & Jakobsson et al. (2010) Nat. Cell Biol. VEGF-VEGFR2-Dll4-Notch1 tip/stalk salt-and-pepper lateral inhibition and angiogenic sprouting faithfully reproduces Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (Retinal & embryonic sprouting vascular endothelium) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (Retinal & embryonic sprouting vascular endothelium) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 51.9/100, audit 2026-10-19-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py> ;
    schema:about "Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (Retinal & embryonic sprouting vascular endothelium)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2021-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch.py; output: docs/media/vascular_angiogenesis_notch_comparison.png; organism: Homo sapiens / Mus musculus (Retinal & embryonic sprouting vascular endothelium); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 75ad27375139b901d6c87702d5f02c739a8e698db79579ceae73bdab1d021c1b; artifact_sha256: 752052d83f74a51a8a136bd0628b68dd31a9e00f6acf6e2876d07385b72d3982; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/vascular_angiogenesis_notch/huvec_angiogenic_sprouting_plexus_specimen.jpg=9bf4f3e2692bd2ac..., datasets/vascular_angiogenesis_notch/paper_citations.bib=a96e44f99de8a756..., datasets/vascular_angiogenesis_notch/scout_manifest.json=2b97b38c418e4c44..., datasets/vascular_angiogenesis_notch/vascular_angiogenesis_notch_reference.json=8821743569ceaf2e...}" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1006/jtbi.1996.0233>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2009.06.004>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature05571>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/ncb2103>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1000052> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-model-fidelity>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-morphometric-validation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-overall>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-parameter-expressivity>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-repro-package>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-source-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-audit-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-audit-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-2> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Bentley–Gerhardt–Bates Coupled Endothelial ODE Network Driving Period-2 Salt-and-Pepper Tip-Cell vs Stalk-Cell Alternation & DAPT Hypersprouting Transition" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidence 5.19e-01 .

