<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bentley, Gerhardt & Bates (2008) PLoS Comput. Biol., Hellström et al. (2007) Nature & Jakobsson et al. (2010) Nat. Cell Biol. VEGF-VEGFR2-Dll4-Notch1 tip/stalk salt-and-pepper lateral inhibition and angiogenic sprouting — Model fidelity to source: 54/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Integrates a minimal two-cell Dll4-Notch1 ODE (L26-66), but omits the M=16 multicellular endothelial vessel wall network, 2D filopodial angiogenic sprout elongation and anastomosis/syncytial fusion, VEGFR1 (sFlt1) decoy sequestration, and Brillouin k=pi Fourier mode decomposition." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
