<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bentley, Gerhardt & Bates (2008) PLoS Comput. Biol., Hellström et al. (2007) Nature & Jakobsson et al. (2010) Nat. Cell Biol. VEGF-VEGFR2-Dll4-Notch1 tip/stalk salt-and-pepper lateral inhibition and angiogenic sprouting — Morphometric validation: 51/100" ;
